#: style.css
msgctxt "Name of the theme"
msgid "WPCredits"
msgstr ""

#: style.css
msgctxt "Description of the theme"
msgid ""
"A block theme and the front end for the WPCredits Program Manager plugin. "
"Gives the program a landing page built from patterns, a branded login, and a "
"full-width \"My Students\" template that dresses the plugin's own mentor "
"dashboard as a compact, triaged, printable list. Chrome follows the "
"WordPress Education Initiatives site; inside the dashboard the patterns are "
"wp-admin native."
msgstr ""

